              of this square is invertible, if for every
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Kan+complex"} Kan complex
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
