            %p
              if any of the four functors is
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/fully+faithful+functor"} fully faithful functor
              = succeed "." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/derived+functor"} derived functor
          .proof
            %h6#proof_5 Proof
            %p
              Observing that each of the four functors is either the leftmost or the rightmost adjoint in the top or the bottom
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/adjoint+triple"} adjoint triple
              within the
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/adjoint+quadruple"} adjoint quadruple
              = succeed "." do
                %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#DerivedAdjointModalityFromQuillenAdjointQuadruple"}
          %p In summary
          #DerivedAdjointModalitiesFromFullyFaithfulQuillenAdjointQuadruples.num_prop
            %h6#proposition_2 Proposition
            %p
              %strong
                (
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/derived+functor"} derived
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/adjoint+modalities"} adjoint modalities
                from
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/fully+faithful+functor"} fully faithful
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Quillen+adjoint+quadruples"} Quillen adjoint quadruples
            %p
              Given a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Quillen+adjoint+quadruple"} Quillen adjoint quadruple
              (Def.
              = succeed ")" do
                %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#QuillenAdjointTriple"}
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msub
                      %mi 𝒞
                      %mn 1
                    %munderover
