                    Ho(\mathcal{D})
            %p
              Moreover, if one of the functors in the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Quillen+adjoint+quadruple"} Quillen adjoint quadruple
              is a
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/fully+faithful+functor"} fully faithful functor
              = succeed "." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/derived+functor"} derived functor
            %p
              Hence if the original
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/adjoint+quadruple"} adjoint quadruple
              induces an
